IMAGINATIVE SCRATCH WORKSHOP (optional): speculative mechanisms, counterfactuals, contradictions, rough fragments, and unresolved questions are explicitly welcome. Explore boldly. Scratch remains advisory: storage alone never makes it a fact, evidence, a formal claim, or support for one.